<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lowe's started as neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lowe's started as neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said Friday it had started coverage of Lowe's Cos Inc with a rating of neutral.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Susan Quilty was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the North Wilkesboro, N.C., home improvement retailer closed at 35 Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
